# Applies to the build context at the repository root (docker build -f services/analyzer-service/Dockerfile ... .).
# Everything is excluded, then only what the image build needs is let back in: no .env, no keys, no other service.
*
!contracts/redaction-rules.yaml
!contracts/canonical_dictionary.csv
!services/analyzer-service/settings.gradle.kts
!services/analyzer-service/build.gradle.kts
!services/analyzer-service/config
!services/analyzer-service/config/**
!services/analyzer-service/src
!services/analyzer-service/src/main
!services/analyzer-service/src/main/**
